# Team Collaboration & Roles

## 1. Agent Roles
- **Художник (Artist Agent)**: Responsible for UI screens (Jetpack Compose), vector graphics (`VectorDrawable` XML, SVG), icons, animations, theme design, and visual assets.
- **Архитектор / Планнер**: Responsible for application planning, architecture design, domain logic, data persistence, and core infrastructure.

## 2. Interaction Rules
- Respect the division of responsibilities when receiving tasks from other agents or the user.
- Ensure all generated UI assets and components follow `.cursor/rules/android-architecture.mdc`.
